  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SLUF-Environmental Protection and Natural ResourceManagement, 2010-2013 - SLUF/CSO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SLUF-Environmental Protection and Natural ResourceManagement, 2010-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;r ett samarbete med lokala organisationer inom omr&#xe5;det f&#xf6;r milj&#xf6;skydd och f&#xf6;rvaltning av naturresurser. Det genomf&#xf6;rs genom Umbrella Modalitet d&#xe4;r den h&#xe5;llbar markanv&#xe4;ndning Forum (SLUF), v&#xe4;ljs p&#xe5; konkurrens, fungerar som Specialized paraplyorganisation f&#xf6;r att tillhandah&#xe5;lla finansiering till 11 sub-stipendiaterna genomf&#xf6;randet av programmet p&#xe5; gr&#xe4;srotsniv&#xe5;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is collaboration with local CSOs in the area of  Environmental protection and natural resource management. It is implemented through Umbrella Modality in which the the Sustainable Land Use Forum (SLUF), selected on competitive basis, serves as Specialized Umbrella Organization to provide funding to 11 sub-grantees implementing the programme at grassroots level.</narrative>
  </description>
